  "description": "Dreadnought is our brawler refined, but it’s never been a one-track mind. Same category defying intent, sharpened in the details that make it work everywhere. It is the bike you can pedal to the top, point into the rough, and still be smiling when the day turns into “one more lap.”\n\nAt the heart of it is our V2 Trifecta suspension system, the same design approach proven on Druid and Supernought, tuned for Dreadnought’s all-around mission. This is not a “more travel” story. It is a ride feel story. More traction when the trail gets loose, more support when you are pushing, and more composure when the speed climbs, whether you are racing enduro, riding park laps, or hunting big mountain lines.\n\nFrom the cockpit of Dreadnought, you stop seeing obstacles and start seeing options. Go further. Ride faster. Choose the harder line.\n\nFear Nothing.\n\nDreadnought is our brawler refined, but it’s never been a one-track mind. Same category defying intent, sharpened in the details that make it work everywhere. It is the bike you can pedal to the top, point into the rough, and still be smiling when the day turns into “one more lap.”\n\nAt the heart of it is our V2 Trifecta suspension system, the same design approach proven on Druid and Supernought, tuned for Dreadnought’s all-around mission. This is not a “more travel” story. It is a ride feel story. More traction when the trail gets loose, more support when you are pushing, and more composure when the speed climbs, whether you are racing enduro, riding park laps, or hunting big mountain lines.\n\nFrom the cockpit of Dreadnought, you stop seeing obstacles and start seeing options. Go further. Ride faster. Choose the harder line.\n\nFear Nothing.",
